  "footnotes": [],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 46 as printed (incl. sub-heading 'Lead:' and Total).",
   "Quantity unit printed after the commodity name (piculs / do / pieces) is given in parentheses in the first column; rows without a printed unit have none.",
   "'Tin, Yunan' as printed.",
   "Row 'Feathers', col '1923 — Value': second digit overprinted/smudged (5 followed by 0 or 9) — unreadable, '[?]'.",
   "Rows 'Fungus' 1923 value (466) and 'Grass cloth' 1923 value (3,568): last digit slightly doubled in the scan but read with reasonable confidence.",
   "Total check 1903 value: sum of items = 8,276, reconciles with printed total (Silk sub-rows Filature/Waste empty).",
   "Total check 1923 value: items excluding the Filature and Waste sub-rows sum to 24,518 plus the unreadable Feathers cell; printed total 24,577 would require Feathers = 59. Not used to fill the cell (rule 3); left '[?]'.",
   "Silk, raw, total 1923 (9,101) is not equal to Filature + Waste (2,783 + 4,738 = 7,521); kept as printed (other raw silk presumably not itemised)."
  ],
